# Level 5 authorization code.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` (git-ignored) and set your own value, then
# restart the dev server. With nothing set, the Level 5 gate renders an
# "access control not configured" state rather than letting anyone through.
#
# NOT A SECRET. Vite inlines every VITE_* variable into the client bundle, so
# this value ships in the JavaScript and can be read by anyone who looks. It is
# a deliberate in-universe gate for a fictional archive, not access control.
# Never put a real credential here.
VITE_INGEN_LEVEL5_PASSWORD=
